{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日更新出来なくてごめなさあーい！！！ぺこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、横浜パシフィコで、個握があったねんねんねねん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装はといいますと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5389559/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうじゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう見えてまだ現役高校生じゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は高3グループがやたらセーラー服多かったんだよね(*^^*)❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり制服がコスプレになる前にきとこう！！っていうこんたんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレになるのかぁ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌だ。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はいつまでもいつまでもピーターパン能條でいるんだぞ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねー！？みんな！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5389559/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の94年組セーラー服軍団。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人になんかならないんだぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベロベロバーーー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もたくさんのおめでとうを言ってくださってありがとお❤❤❤❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれちかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気もりもりだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、そうなのよ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいてて声カサカサでハスキーもどきになってたのを心配してくれた皆様、ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫でございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって高校3年生だもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返す(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きな漫画は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.漫画かぁーあみあんまり読まないんだけど、まあ唯一読んでたのは、僕の初恋を君に捧ぐってやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみちゃんの尊敬してる人が目の前に現れたらどーするぅぅぅ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.まずは、自己紹介。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、全握でお昼何食べたか教えてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.確か、チーズハンバーグだった気がするよ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、「吊しやがって」も(o^-')b\n・吊るしたら難しくて分からない\n・秋刀魚が可哀想のどっちの気持ちだったんでしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.魚が可哀想って意味よお  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみ好きになっちゃったのであみあみ族に\n入っても良いですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.もちろんですっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようこそあみあみ族へ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなのことが、大好き。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5389559/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気にしない。\n木にしない。"}],"source":"archive"}